MCL-IP carriage, DFR1154 autonomous node <-> independent Python implementation
2026-09-08

RIG
  node       DFR1154 (FireBeetle 2 ESP32-S3), scenario 3, SoftAP mcl-auto-node
             firmware sha256 76E21D1CD3F4370C4D11997CDE4359F079D3D63EADCBDB1B031D251D4ED30DFA
  host       Windows laptop, Realtek RTL8188EU USB adapter ("Wi-Fi 2"), the
             project adapter. The internal MediaTek adapter carries the
             internet and was not touched.
  path       2.4 GHz, 192.168.4.2 -> 192.168.4.1:47100, RTT ~3 ms
  frames     built and checked by mcl-core/conformance/independent/
             mcl_independent.py -- no shared source, language or build system
             with the reference C running on the board

